      "bottom": 2231.4,
      "x": 300,
      "width": 1331.7795275590554,
      "text": "10 correctness tests; independent score/queue checks; 394-column quality audit; 1/3/7-day block sensitivity. Clean installation + synthetic end-to-end passed; no full real-data refit in that environment."
    },
